### =====================================================
### USER SERVICE
### =====================================================

### 1. Create User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vijay",
  "email": "vijay@gmail.com",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}


### 2. Get All Users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users


### 3. Get User By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1


### 4. Update User
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vijay Kumar",
  "email": "vijaykumar@gmail.com",
  "phone": "9876543211"
}


### 5. Delete User
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/1



### =====================================================
### HELPER SERVICE
### =====================================================

### 6. Create Helper
POST http://localhost:8080/api/helpers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vikram",
  "phone": "9876543212",
  "available": true
}


### 7. Get All Helpers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/helpers


### 8. Get Helper By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/helpers/1


### 9. Update Helper
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/helpers/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "varun",
  "phone": "1234567890",
  "available": true
}


### 10. Delete Helper
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/helpers/1



### =====================================================
### ASSISTANT REQUEST SERVICE
### =====================================================

### 11. Create Assistant Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickupPoint": "Main Gate",
  "startTime": "2026-09-28T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-09-28T10:30:00",
  "assistanceType": "Wheelchair"
}


### 12. Get All Assistant Requests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/requests


### 13. Get Assistant Request By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1


### 14. Update Assistant Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickupPoint": "Library",
  "startTime": "2026-09-28T11:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-09-28T11:30:00",
  "assistanceType": "Wheelchair"
}


### 15. Complete Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/complete


### 16. Cancel Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/cancel


### 17. Delete Assistant Request
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1
